Provenance
----------
Every glyph is an original drawing. The outlines are computed from this
project's own design tokens by this project's own code (see
docs/adr/0001-parametric-glyph-source.md). No third-party font outlines,
icon sets or SVGs were copied or traced. Mapping some glyphs to standard
Unicode code points (for example U+2192 RIGHTWARDS ARROW) uses the Unicode
standard and implies no third-party design.

